Third-party assets

muse bundles no typeface. Icon names are referenced by string and resolved at runtime by
the consumer's Iconify runtime; muse redistributes no icon artwork.

If a typeface is reintroduced, record its licence here before the files are committed, and
keep `src/lib/styles/fonts.test.ts` passing — muse is distributed to every Facile app, so a
font added to this repo is a font redistributed thirteen times over.
